ies": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 26}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [76], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["video"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 200], "pos": [580, 0], "id": 63, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [34], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 77, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 154], "pos": [820, 0], "id": 4, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "文本", "links": [77], "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["这些图和你给的描述，核心不是普通“通勤列车抓拍”，而是非常明确的几个要素叠加：\n\n- 拥挤地铁/通勤列车环境\n- 斜后方、略微仰拍的乘客视角\n- 单人女性主体，白色轻薄上衣 + 浅色包臀裙\n- 低马尾、碎发、通勤妆、精致五官\n- 一只手抓扶手，身体轻微失衡或扭转\n- 轻微动态模糊、手机随手拍感、非正式构图\n- 背景是模糊的乘客、扶手、车厢灯光和金属杆件\n\n但你这版描述里有两个问题我不建议保留为“通用提示词”的核心：\n\n1. `未察觉到镜头存在`\n2. `让人忍不住多看一眼` 并把重点明显放在身体性吸引上\n\n这会把画面推向偷拍/窥视感。这个方向不适合作为我帮你优化的通用模板。  \n如果你的目标是复现这种“通勤环境里的惊艳感”，可以改成更安全、也更稳定出图的版本：`通勤时刻的电影感抓拍 / 时尚通勤人像 / 地铁里的自然瞬间`。\n\n下面给你的是基于这些图抽出来的**安全通用提示词**。\n\n**通用基准 prompt**\n```text\nA cinematic candid-style photo of a striking young woman on a crowded morning commuter train, elegant and naturally eye-catching, soft black hair tied in a low ponytail, delicate facial features, large expressive eyes, defined nose bridge, glossy lips, small face, long graceful neck, slim feminine figure. She wears a light semi-sheer white blouse with natural wrinkles and a fitted beige skirt. She is holding an overhead hand strap in a crowded subway carriage, captured in a fleeting moment of slight imbalance as the train moves. Shot from a passenger perspective at a diagonal rear three-quarter angle, slightly low angle, casual phone-camera framing, subtle motion blur, imperfect composition, realistic fluorescent subway lighting, busy commuters in the background, metal poles and hand straps visible, urban commuting atmosphere, photorealistic, natural candid fashion editorial mood.\n```\n\n这条已经足够接近，但如果你要更像你贴的样图，真正要稳定的是“结构化模板”，不是一句长话。\n\n**结构化通用模板**\n```text\nphotorealistic candid commuter portrait, crowded subway train, morning rush hour, elegant young woman as the clear focal subject, {hairstyle}, {top}, {skirt}, holding overhead strap, slight body twist, subtle loss of balance, diagonal rear three-quarter angle, slightly low camera angle, passenger-eye-level phone shot, casual imperfect framing, mild motion blur, shallow depth of field, fluorescent train lighting, metal poles, hand straps, blurred office commuters, realistic urban atmosphere, understated cinematic fashion realism\n```\n\n推荐变量这样填：\n\n- `{hairstyle}`  \n  `soft black low ponytail with loose strands around the face`\n\n- `{top}`  \n  `a semi-sheer white blouse with soft wrinkles`  \n  或  \n  `a lightweight white blouse with translucent texture`\n\n- `{skirt}`  \n  `a fitted beige pencil skirt`  \n  或  \n  `a slim beige high-waisted skirt`\n\n如果你想更像图 1 到图 4 的共同气质，可以继续补这段：\n\n```text\nsmartphone snapshot aesthetic, natural commuter elegance, understated beauty, fleeting glance over the shoulder, soft skin texture, realistic facial proportions, no studio lighting, no posed glamour shoot, no fantasy styling, no exaggerated makeup, no text, no watermark\n```\n\n**更适合中文模型的通用版**\n```text\n拥挤早班地铁里的自然抓拍风人像，一位气质出众的年轻通勤女性作为画面主体，黑色低马尾，脸侧有少量碎发，五官精致，双眼明亮，鼻梁清晰，嘴唇有轻微光泽，脸小，脖颈修长，身形纤细。她穿轻薄略带半透明质感的白色衬衫和米色修身半裙，一只手抓着头顶扶手，列车行进中身体有轻微失衡和回身动作。镜头从乘客视角拍摄，斜后方三分之四角度，略微仰拍，像手机随手拍到的瞬间，构图不刻意，带一点动态模糊，背景是拥挤乘客、金属扶杆、拉环和地铁冷白灯光，整体写实、自然、城市通勤感强，像时尚感很轻的电影抓拍照片。\n```\n\n**如果你要更偏“图像生成稳定性”的短版**\n```text\ncrowded subway candid photo, elegant young woman in white semi-sheer blouse and fitted beige skirt, black low ponytail, holding overhead strap, slight body twist, diagonal rear angle, slightly low angle, phone camera snapshot, mild motion blur, realistic commuters and subway poles in background, fluorescent train lighting, photorealistic urban commute fashion portrait\n```\n\n**从这组图里总结出来的通用关键词**\n- `crowded subway`\n- `morning commute`\n- `candid commuter portrait`\n- `rear three-quarter angle`\n- `slightly low angle`\n- `holding overhead strap`\n- `semi-sheer white blouse`\n- `fitted beige skirt`\n- `low ponytail`\n- `subtle motion blur`\n- `smartphone snapshot aesthetic`\n- `fluorescent train lighting`\n- `blurred commuters`\n- `urban realism`\n- `natural fashion editorial`\n\n**不建议保留的关键词**\n- `unaware of the camera`\n- `secretly photographed`\n- `voyeuristic`\n- `men can’t help staring`\n- 任何明显把重点放在性吸引和偷看感上的措辞\n\n如果你要继续，我可以直接给你三套成品版本：\n\n1. `更像抖音/小红书手机抓拍`\n2. `更像电影剧照`\n3. `更像写实 AI 通勤海报`\n\n这样你可以直接拿去跑图。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "编辑文本"}, "name": "编辑文本", "label": "编辑文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "编辑文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "MuyeTextEditOutput", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [240, 838], "pos": [340, 0], "id": 62, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MuyeTextEditOutput"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4244.16357421875, 188.47705078125], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-1162.081